{"version":1,"content":"<p>「明報高中生升學博覽會2026」今（1日）於九龍香格里拉酒店宴會大禮堂舉行，逾20間本地及海外升學機構參展，吸引大批家長及學生到場諮詢。</p><p>有升學機構指出，由於海外留學成本高昂，加上本港大學排名屢創新高，大部分家長及學生選擇留港升學。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:48.223227+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T10:25:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:44.898798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.768580+00:00","content_hash":"b3a4f99b4c91dbd0b4e0b01ac7087b35fdc910795a5058883f230a61a03ab709","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}